{"pin":"AB07759","subcodes":[{"code":"AB07759","anchor":"","first_line":"Thou knowest that the people are encircled with pain and calamities and are environed with hardships and trouble. Every trial doth attack man","first_line_orig":"رب انت تعلم بان النفوس محفوفه بالنواب و الافات و محاطه بالمصائب و الرزیات کل بلاء  ","language":"Ara","word_count":"110","full_text_parts":["O my Lord!  Thou knowest that the people are encircled with pain and calamities and are environed with hardships and trouble.  Every trial doth attack man and every dire adversity doth assail him like unto the assault of a serpent.  There is no shelter and asylum for him except under the wing of Thy protection, preservation, guard and custody.\nO Thou the Merciful One!  O my Lord!  Make Thy protection my armor, Thy preservation my shield, humbleness before the door of Thy oneness my guard, and Thy custody and defense my fortress and my abode. Preserve me from the suggestions of self and desire, and guard me from every sickness, trial, difficulty and ordeal.\nVerily, Thou art the Protector, the Guardian, the Preserver, the Sufficer, and verily, Thou art the Merciful of the Most Merciful."],"translations":[{"language":"ml","lang_name":"Malayalam"},{"language":"ru","lang_name":"Russian"},{"language":"es","lang_name":"Spanish"},{"language":"am","lang_name":"Amharic"},{"language":"bg","lang_name":"Bulgarian"},{"language":"ro","lang_name":"Romanian"},{"language":"lb","lang_name":"Luxembourgish"},{"language":"lg","lang_name":"Ganda"},{"language":"tl","lang_name":"Tagalog"},{"language":"uk","lang_name":"Ukrainian"},{"language":"mh","lang_name":"Marshallese"},{"language":"fi","lang_name":"Finnish"},{"language":"iba","lang_name":"Iban"},{"language":"hy","lang_name":"Armenian"},{"language":"kl","lang_name":"Kalaallisut"},{"language":"mg","lang_name":"Malagasy"},{"language":"mn","lang_name":"Mongolian"},{"language":"kn","lang_name":"Kannada"},{"language":"da","lang_name":"Danish"},{"language":"fr","lang_name"